  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/2NhFzEH.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NRXgwGS.png\"></strong></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://imgur.com/u7ewoYM.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>更多狙擊槍圖庫：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dg9ajCy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"613\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PfaUWc9.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C69xu47.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rD0sFls.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e9VQnEi.png\"></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VY78uyc.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>更多冷案行動圖片：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yq9PUV9.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oaAmASx.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VY78uyc.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lV4DTuG.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/juJCs1z.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lVRyQtq.png\"></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/llsYobO.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>更多金字塔圖片：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6LYrVSp.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6uUDiio.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LJTFlED.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RA5DTWx.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sIJXu3Y.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QLHz04b.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XZipWgP.png\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>實用連結：</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1ez0pIETwoIxed3IJ048_SG7XCKmxh7wG-Y6YlLZqqho/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><u>精通任務與技能</u></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ht3t534Q4e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Discord 伺服器</strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>設定配置</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">伺服器設定</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">客戶端設定（可在遊戲中使用<strong><em>/ava clientConfig</em></strong>指令存取）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">可使用資料包來設定大部分武器數值</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">更多資訊請造訪：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f834742557203628052%252f1077114092139073616%252f1077117286000885760\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/834742557203628052/1077114092139073616/1077117286000885760</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>操作控制：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ne-4YQ5KmnDOejJ1YnoZ0Jwr-kktG236Gui9pktH60s/edit\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ne-4YQ5KmnDOejJ1YnoZ0Jwr-kktG236Gui9pktH60s</a></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>指令列表：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eoeW4uLsfjIrToi_KastPmSjT9RRbHP_DJOZYzGKRhE/edit\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1eoeW4uLsfjIrToi_KastPmSjT9RRbHP_DJOZYzGKRhE</a></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/CR03eLe.png\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>合成系統：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tUEIBOY3d_o\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tUEIBOY3d_o</a></p>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/CR03eLe.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">移除模組：</span></p><p>此模組包含一個開發中的維度，移除後會導致部分原版資料包錯誤</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如同原版警告所述，實驗性設定可能導致問題，例如世界損毀</p>\n<p>我發現這是由世界生成引起的（已使用暮光森林測試，出現相同損毀情況），理解這非常令人困擾，在此為造成的不便致歉</p>\n<p>無論如何，</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MinecraftForge/MinecraftForge/issues/8800#issuecomment-1178330353\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MinecraftForge/MinecraftForge/issues/8800#issuecomment-1178330353</a></p>\n<p>此連結應能修復該錯誤</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>語言支援：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">俄文 (145play145)；德文 (zJustCombo)；越南文 (MaidenVans)；土耳其文 (StatiK_404)；法文 (Eric LEGUEBE)；韓文 (jinwk00)</strong></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">翻譯可能因更新而不完整</strong></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地圖：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/alliance-of-valiant-arms-annihilation\" rel=\"nofollow\">特戰英豪：殲滅戰</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/alliance-of-valiant-arms-demolition-half-ai\" rel=\"nofollow\">特戰英豪：爆破行動（半AI）</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/a-v-a-prison-break-escape\" rel=\"nofollow\">A.V.A：監獄脫逃</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>資源包：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/a-v-a-official-addon-hd-weapon-models-resource\" rel=\"nofollow\">A.V.A：高畫質武器模型</a>&nbsp;</span>由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/jinwk00/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">jinwk00</a> 製作</p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>遇到問題或有想法建議？</strong></span></p><p>_**<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbitbucket.org%252fpelluciddice%252fava%252fissues%253fstatus%253dnew%2526status%253dopen**_\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bitbucket.org/pelluciddice/ava/issues?status=new&amp;status=open**_</a></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IMMvIPy.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjinwk00.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">jinwk00</a> 製作</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1lsb0j.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>由 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCC-prXoUl2Ycg8GhxYKO4nQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaludi</a> 製作</p>",
